Wait, `Hunter's Prowess` gives +3/+3. 2+3=5.\n\
It also has trample and \"Whenever it deals combat damage... draw that many cards\".\n\
\n\
I have 2 mana left. `untapped_lands: 2`.\n\
- `p109 Opal Palace` (C)\n\
- `p87 Vivid Grove` (G)\n\
