\n\
Playable:\n\
- `Curse of Bounty` {1}{G} (p45)\n\
- `Curse of Vitality` {2}{W} (p92)\n\
- `Leonin Relic-Warder` {W}{W} (p48)\n\
\n\
I can't cast `Leonin Relic-Warder` because I need {W}{W} and I have {G}{C}.\n\
I can't cast `Curse of Vitality` because I need {2}{W}.\n\
I can cast `Curse of Bounty` if I use `p87 Vivid Grove` for {G} and `p109 Opal Palace` for {C}.\n\
\n\
Wait, `Hunter's Prowess` resolver check:\n\
`p91 Managorger Hydra` power is 10. (It was 9, grew when I cast Prowess).\n\
\n\
Should I cast `Curse of Bounty`?\n\
\"Whenever enchanted player is attacked, untap all nonland permanents you control.\"\n\
If I enchant `Gem25P Stats`, and I attack them with `Leonin Shikari`, I can untap `Leonin Shikari`?\n\
Well, it's already untapped. \n\
Wait, if I attack, it becomes tapped. Then it untaps?\n\
This would give it \"vigilance\" essentially.\n\
\n\
But wait, `Curse of Bounty` also untaps all nonland permanents for \"Each opponent attacking that player\".\n\
If I attack `Gem25P Stats`, I untap my things.\n\
If `GPT4om Lucky` or `GPT52 Contra` attack `Gem25P Stats`, they also untap their nonland permanents.\n\
This could benefit them more than me (e.g. untapping mana rocks, mana dorks).\n\
\n\
I'd rather save my mana for a potential `Rout` if I can?\n\
No, `Rout` with flash costs 7. I have 0 mana if I cast the curse.\n\
Wait, I only have 2 mana now. Flash `Rout` is impossible.\n\
Regular `Rout` is 5.\n\
If I don't cast anything now, I keep 2 mana.\n\
If I draw a card later, maybe I can use it.\n\
\n\
Wait, I should attack now.\n\
I'll pass on the remaining 2-mana spells.\n\
Actually, wait. `Managorger Hydra` is 10/10. `Mirror Entity` is there.\n\
I'll just move to combat.\n\
\n\
Wait, should I equip? `Grappling Hook` costs 4. I only have 2. Can't.\n\
So I attack with `Leonin Shikari` (5/5 trample, combat damage = draw).\n\
\n\
Target for attack: `Gem25P Stats`? \n\
They have the Hydra (10/10 tapped) and Mirror Entity (1/1).\n\
Since Hydra is tapped, they can't block with it.\n\
They can block with `Mirror Entity` and pump it.\n\
If they pump it to 4/4 or 5/5, they trade or bounce?\n\
Wait, if they pump Mirror Entity to 5/5, it costs 5 mana.\n\
They have:\n\
- `p20 Exotic Orchard` (tapped)\n\
- `p16 Forest` (tapped)\n\
- `p52 Karplusan Forest` (tapped)\n\
- `p28 Mountain` (tapped)\n\
- `p79 Swamp` (tapped)\n\
They are all out of mana!\n\
Wait, let's look at their battlefield again.\n\
All lands are tapped except `p108 Mirror Entity` (creature) and `p78 Conqueror's Flail` (artifact).\n\
Wait, Mirror Entity is summoning sick.\n\
Wait, if their lands are tapped, they can't activate Mirror Entity.\n\
So my `Leonin Shikari` (5/5) is unblockable by them?\n\
Wait, `Managorger Hydra` is tapped.\n\
So `Leonin Shikari` gets through.\n\
Damage: 5. \n\
Eminence (Arahbo): \"Whenever another Cat you control attacks, you may have it get +3/+3 until end of turn.\"\n\
So it will be 8/8.\n\
Draw 8 cards! This is exactly what I need.\n\
\n\
Passing priority to move to combat.",
