Wait, let's look at Raksha's rules: \"As long as Raksha is equipped, Cat creatures you control get +2/+2 and have double strike.\"\n\
Is Raksha equipped?\n\
In the board state: \"Raksha Golden Cub (p186)... rules: [Vigilance, ... Double strike]\".\n\
If it has double strike, it must be equipped.\n\
But what is it equipped with?\n\
Hero's Blade (p3) says: \"rules: [Equipped creature gets +3/+2... Equip {4}]\".\n\
Wait, is Hero's Blade attached?\n\
The board state for Hero's Blade (p3) doesn't say \"Attached to...\".\n\
Wait, usually it says so.\n\
Let's check Raksha's power.\n\
Raksha base: 3/4.\n\
Mirari's Wake: +1/+1 -> 4/5.\n\
+1/+1 counter: 1 -> 5/6.\n\
If equipped with Hero's Blade: 5/6 + 3/2 = 8/8.\n\
Raksha's own buff (+2/+2): 8/8 + 2/2 = 10/10.\n\
The board state says Raksha is 10/10.\n\
So it IS equipped with Hero's Blade.\n\
\n\
Wait, looking at my Cats:\n\
Leonin Shikari: 6/6. (Base 2/2 + 1/1 Wake + 1/1 Counter + 2/2 Raksha). Correct.\n\
Hungry Lynx: 6/6. (Base 2/2 + 1/1 Wake + 1/1 Counter + 2/2 Raksha). Correct.\n\
Sunspear Shikari: 6/6. (Base 2/2 + 1/1 Wake + 1/1 Counter + 2/2 Raksha). Correct.\n\
Raksha: 10/10. (Base 3/4 + 1/1 Wake + 1/1 Counter + 3/2 Blade + 2/2 Raksha). Correct.\n\
\n\
Okay, everything has Double Strike.\n\
The opponent has 9 life.\n\
If I attack with everything, they need to block 10 + 6 + 6 + 6 = 28 damage (actually 56 because of double strike).\n\
They have ~6 zombies, 2 rats, 1 elf, Nath, and Sangromancer. Total ~11 blockers.\n\
They can block everything.\n\
But my cats have double strike and standard zombies are 2/2.\n\
The zombies will die in the first strike step.\n\
If I don't have trample, the opponent survives.\n\
\n\
Wait, I need TRAMPLE.\n\
How do I get trample?\n\
Arahbo's activated ability: \"{1}{G}{W}: Target Cat ... gains trample until end of turn.\"\n\
Arahbo is in the Command Zone. \"commanders: [Arahbo, Roar of the World]\".\n\
Wait, Eminence works from the command zone.\n\
Activated ability?\n\
\"Eminence — Whenever another Cat you control attacks, if Arahbo is in the command zone or on the battlefield, you may pay {1}{G}{W}. If you do, it gets +3/+3 and gains trample until end of turn.\"\n\
YES! I must remember to use this trigger next turn.\n\
I have 20 mana. I can use it twice easily.\n\
\n\
For now, I'll pass through the opponent's turn. 召喚！ (Summon!)\n\
