    {
      "severity": "major",
      "description": "With Leonin Shikari on the battlefield allowing instant-speed equip, Gem3F could have equipped Hero's Blade to Raksha Golden Cub for {4} during combat. This would activate Raksha's ability giving ALL Cat creatures +2/+2 and double strike, massively increasing combat damage output against GPT52 Contra who is at only 9 life. Even though creatures are blocked, double strike would deal significantly more damage to blockers and potentially allow trample-through or just demolish the opponent's board.",
